abstract: >-
  Version 2.0.0 adds the folder v2_rate_matching_study: the code, protocol, per-window predictions and
  verification scripts of a 90-run comparison of rate-matched and native-rate surface EMG in a dual-branch
  EMG-IMU network (SDALLE dataset, nine participants, leave-one-participant-out, five seeds; protocol-specified
  primary analysis, not fully prespecified). Software source code is licensed under the MIT License; documentation,
  figures, result tables, and derived outputs are shared under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0).
  Version 1.0.0 (tag v1.0.0) is unchanged.
